From 94959a38d33dbfd145302bf5e0775f5071a2716c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: axon7-build <axon7-build@localhost>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 08:32:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 19/20] ASoC: AK4490 Hi-Fi DAC, AK8157 PLL, ISL98608 supply
 from the ZTE 3.18 kernel (axon7)

The msm8996-ak496x card has an ak4490-AIF1 link (headphones), so the card
never registered without this codec. 4.4: own register cache instead of
codec->reg_cache, snd_soc_codec_get_dapm(), no readable/volatile hooks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FVN6i29oeF8XZDRKkkCQqG
Change-Id: Ib81b1d78d93377b239bf73ca1f757f44d6d0be80
